{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56617","headline":"唐八棱贴银镀金海上仙真八卦花鸟镜铭 · 无名氏","name":"唐八棱贴银镀金海上仙真八卦花鸟镜铭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舞凤归林近，盘龙渡海新。\n缄封待还归，披拂鉴情亲。\n只影若爲客，孤鸣复几春。\n初成照瞻镜，遥忆画眉人。\n（以上二首见沈从文《唐宋铜镜》，中国古典艺术出版社一九五八年出版。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56617.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56617","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}